WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:10.870
Pteronophobia is the fear of being tickled
by feathers.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:18.220
It cost 7 million dollars to build the Titanic
and 200 million dollars to make a film about

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.220
it.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:25.179
There is enough water in Lake Superior to
cover all of North and South America in one

00:00:25.179 --> 00:00:26.810
foot of liquid.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:34.000
when Star Wars: A New Hope hit theatres in
1977, France was still executing people using

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.440
the guillotine.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.960
Owls don't have eyeballs.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.670
They have eye tubes.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.450
When hippos are upset or angry, their sweat
turns red.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.149
Camel's milk doesn't curdle.

00:00:47.149 --> 00:00:54.550
Nowhere in the Humpty Dumpty Nursery Rhyme
does it say that Humpty Dumpty is an egg.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:58.100
Most streets in Japan don't have names.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.500
They instead use an addressing system where
they divide areas into blocks and give the

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.200
blocks numbers.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.370
The only two animals that can see behind themselves
without turning their head are the rabbit

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.370
and the parrot.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:17.160
Elephants have a specific alarm call that
means "human".

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.310
It sounds like a deep rumble.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:25.030
Horses use facial expressions and move their
ears to communicate with each other.

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:32.070
Every possible starting position of a standard
Rubik's Cube can be solved in 20 moves or

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.070
less.

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:38.050
There is only one country between North Korea
and Norway, Russia.

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:43.630
New York City is farther south than Rome.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:53.520
Oxford University is older than the Aztec
Empire by over 300 years.

